    <comp lib="7" loc="(115,4445)" name="Text">
      <a name="font" val="SansSerif bold 13"/>
      <a name="halign" val="left"/>
      <a name="text">This unit serves two primary purposes. 

Firstly, the CM unit handles acceleration of syscall execution by
using the auto-ticking clock during execution of kernel code.

Secondly, the CM unit implements suspension of the
processor upon any of the following:
 - Special kernel instruction for exiting program is run
 - Jump/Branch to invalid program counter address occurs
 - Breakpoint is enabled and reached</a>
    </comp>
